"""A function of this type is responsible for freeing the pixel array
of a pixbuf.

The GdkPixbuf.Pixbuf.new_from_data() function lets you pass in a pre-allocated
pixel array so that a pixbuf can be created from it; in this case you
will need to pass in a function of type `GdkPixbuf.PixbufDestroyNotify` so that
